{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06261","headline":"冬至下寄舍弟时应赴入京 · 丘爲","name":"冬至下寄舍弟时应赴入京","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"去去知未远，依依甚初别。\n他乡至下心，昨夜堦前雪。\n终日读书仍少孤，家贫兄弟未当途。\n适远才过宿舂料，相随惟一平头奴。\n男儿出门事四海，立身世业文章在。\n莫漫忆柴扉，驷马高车朝紫微。\n江南驿使不曾断，迎前爲尔非春衣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"丘爲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06261.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06261","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}